{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom Shopify section named “UGC Reels + Influencer Stories” with the following behavior and design:
    
    1. **Layout & Display:**
       - Desktop: 5 cards in a row (equal width, grid).
       - Mobile: horizontal scroll carousel (swipeable) with scroll-snap.
       - Show pagination dots **only on mobile**.
       - On mobile, each card takes ~70% of the viewport width.
    
    2. **Card Content (for each of the 5 cards):**
       - Heading (text field) – e.g. “Clear water is the foundation of wellness.”
       - Influencer name (text) + Instagram icon + optional Instagram profile URL.
       - Wistia video embed code (merchant pastes embed HTML / iframe).
       - Desktop thumbnail image (image picker).
       - Mobile image (image picker) — show this on mobile instead of desktop thumbnail.
       - Product name (text) + optional product page URL.
    
    3. **Video Behavior:**
       - Default: paused + muted.
       - When user taps play:
         - Only that video plays.
         - All other videos pause.
         - Play / Pause control toggles.
         - Mute / Unmute control toggles audio.
       - Use Wistia’s API to bind play, pause, volume control.
       - Remove (or hide) default Wistia overlay/control UI to use your custom controls.
    
    4. **Active Card Styling:**
       - When a video is playing (i.e. that card is “active”):
         - The card’s background changes to **soft green** (#D9F5E4).
         - The card height should expand if needed.
         - Influencer name + Instagram line becomes more visible (e.g. fade in or expand).
       - When paused or stopped:
         - Card returns to original background.
         - Remove active-state styling.
    
    5. **Mobile Auto-Advance:**
       - On mobile, when a video ends:
         - Automatically scroll to the **next card**.
         - Auto-play the next video.
       - Update the pagination dots accordingly as it scrolls to the next card.
    
    6. **Styling (CSS):**
       - Rounded corners: 12px.
       - Soft box-shadow on cards.
       - Smooth background-color transition when card becomes active.
